// Article 5. Amendment: two thirds of the owners; no vote for an owner under a lien.
#require "2-assessments.charter".
Fact amendment
Fact voted Identified by owner * amendment
Act vote Actor owner Related to amendment
  Holds when True
  Valid when !lien(owner)
  Creates voted(owner, amendment)
Fact carried Identified by amendment
  Holds when Count(Foreach owner: owner When voted(owner, amendment)) * 3
               >= Count(owner) * 2

Clause 5.1 => carried, vote
Clause 5.2 => vote.
